# Source rasters and tiles: large, redistributable from their own publishers,
# and regenerable by scripts/fetch-bangalore.py. The DERIVED artefacts beside
# this file ARE committed -- footprints, heights and terrain -- because they
# cost a 5-minute Overture scan plus ~20 minutes of Earth Engine to rebuild and
# the Kolkata pipeline commits its equivalents.
raw/

# Scenes are the OUTPUT of those artefacts and rebuild in seconds, so they stay
# out: three .blend files are ~15 MB and six renders another ~13 MB, none of it
# carrying information the artefacts do not already hold.
scenes/

# exFAT on this volume writes AppleDouble sidecars for every file.
._*
